        ]
      },
      "metadata": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": [
              "Documentary note"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "en": [
              "Three columns discuss educational planning, individualised instruction, learning environments, programmed teaching and technology. The Record Card draws attention to the coordination of people, facilities, resources and time, while leaving open how this account relates to Atom."
