      "type": "Canvas",
      "label": {
        "en": [
          "06 — Atom: facilities within a town (pp. 232–233)"
        ]
      },
      "metadata": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": [
              "Documentary note"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "en": [
              "The first double-page spread presents Atom as a proposal for educational facilities integrated with the infrastructure of a new town. Text, a network diagram, building axonometric, plans, sections and photographs bring together a distributed network of local facilities and an adaptable building system. The relationships between facilities, building types and the wider town remain to be examined."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": [
              "Source reference"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "en": [
              "Architectural Design, May 1968, pp. 232–233."
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
