            "en": [
              "Documentary note"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "en": [
              "The second double-page spread continues with text, a large chart, plans and photographs concerning educational facilities, equipment and patterns of provision. The chart relates facility types to use, location and lifespan. It invites comparison with the network and building system presented on pp. 232–233."
