          "10 — OCH: rearrangement and projection (p. 239)"
        ]
      },
      "metadata": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": [
              "Documentary note"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "en": [
              "Text accompanies third- and fourth-floor plans and diagrams of potential banked seating, a triple-projection system and movable floors. The page raises a question about whether the capacity for change extends beyond the rearrangement of physical elements to the organisation of activities and institutions."
            ]
          }
        },
