      "type": "Canvas",
      "label": {
        "en": [
          "11 — The editorial continues (p. 242)"
        ]
      },
      "metadata": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": [
              "Documentary note"
            ]
          },
          "value": {
            "en": [
              "The editorial resumes its argument for lifelong learning beyond conventional educational institutions. It considers learning in homes, workplaces and public settings, with educational provision understood as a continuing service requiring adaptable space and institutional change. The page returns the reader to the question raised on p. 207."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "label": {
